              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Tolim Ekapolon lo erai Ekapolon Akuj tama, “Atachakinete kolong ngitunga a Edom ngakiro naaronok ani a Yuda. Aliwor ibore ngini asechanu naationon ani a Edom. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.25.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.25.12"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "13",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 25:13"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "13",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Alimu tokona ayong atamar erirae Edom ataar ngitunga daang ka ngibaren. Eliwor akwap alaireng napei alore a Teman tanang lore a Dedan, emunyario a akwara daang. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.25.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.25.13"
            ]
          }
        },
